<title>USA: PSE to list United Meridian options Oct 31.</title>
<headline>PSE to list United Meridian options Oct 31.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said Wednesday it would list options on United Meridian Corp on October 31.</p>
<p>The exchange said opening strike prices will be 40, 45 and 50, with initial expirations of November, December, January and April.</p>
<p>The stock was down one at 46-1/8 Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p>The PSE said Sheldon Kahn of Pacific Coast Capital will be lead market maker for the options.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
